      tr: "K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 z\u0131rh kabuklu taze ve sulu karides"
      vi: "T\xF4m di chuy\u1EC3n ch\u1EADm d\u01B0\u1EDBi \u0111\xE1y bi\u1EC3n,
