      it: Forma squisita con ripieno abbondante
      tr: "\xD6zenle \u015Fekillendirilmi\u015F ev yap\u0131m\u0131 lezzet"
      vi: "H\xECnh d\xE1ng tinh x\u1EA3o nh\xE2n \u0111\u1EA7y \u1EAFp h\u01B0\u01A1ng
